Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 12:58:53 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] feat(payments): demand-based surge multipliers

Replace the flat 1.4x surge with a per-city demand curve that peaks in
the evening rush, cached per city for two minutes. Still gated by the
surge_pricing flag.
---
